# Geralf, the Fleshwright cast on turn 1 with Island and two Moxen (his own cast is the third spell of that turn and triggers
# nothing: he was not on the battlefield). On turn 3 Bot1's first spell (Memnite) makes no token; the second (Ornithopter) and
# third (Mox Ruby) each make a 2/2 blue and black Zombie Rogue token. The second token enters with a counter because the first
# entered this turn.

